  <p>If avatar is a child agent, ["NOT ON REGION"] is returned.</p>
  <p>If avatar is not a main agent and not a child agent or not an agent at all, ["NOT FOUND"] is returned.</p>
  <h2>Specification</h2>
  <p>Returns a list of attachments on the avatar.</p>
  <p>By default this function will return all attachments on all attachment points. A script may specify multiple <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=FILTER_INCLUDE&action=edit&redlink=1" target="_blank">FILTER_INCLUDE</a> options which will limit the returned attachments to only those listed.</p>
  <p>If the script specifies the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=FILTER_FLAGS&action=edit&redlink=1" target="_blank">FILTER_FLAGS</a> option with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=FILTER_FLAG_HUDS&action=edit&redlink=1" target="_blank">FILTER_FLAG_HUDS</a> this function will include any attached HUDs if the following conditions are met:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The script must be compiled with an experience</li>
    <li>The experience must be active in the region</li>
    <li>The avatar must have accepted the experience</li>
    <li>The HUD must include at least one script that was also compiled with the same experience.</li>
  </ul>
